      "explanation": "Correct: A. Copilot's plugins span Microsoft security products, so one prompt can be grounded with identity, device and email data together; the model reasons over the combined context. D is wrong: multi-product grounding is the point of the plugin model. B is wrong: SCUs are capacity units, not per-product charges. C is wrong: promptbooks are for multi-step tasks, not for multi-product access.",
