      "explanation": "Correct: D. Defender for Cloud supports continuous export of alerts and recommendations to a Log Analytics workspace, Event Hub or storage, and Sentinel has a Defender for Cloud data connector; either route brings the data into Sentinel. C is wrong: scraping is unsupported and unnecessary. A is wrong: workflow automation triggers Logic Apps on new or changed recommendations/alerts; it is not a bulk historical export. B invents a score threshold.",
      "source_url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/credentials/certifications/resources/study-guides/sc-500",
      "source_title": "SC-500 study guide",
      "source_quote": "\"Manage security posture by using Microsoft Defender for Cloud.\""
